{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《愛．回家之開心速遞》陪伴香港人多年，隨著劇集即將迎來大結局，劇中演員與觀眾都大感不捨。其中憑「島大」女神 Candy 一角深入民心的葉蒨文（Sophie），近日在社交平台晒出多張與同劇演員的珍貴合照，瞬間勾起無數網民的集體回憶！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866766087345069_22458690.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026ubghxQiFvV1785381294.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866766087345069_22458690.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">葉蒨文分享了 Candy 歷年來多個經典又搞笑的造型。除了有令人眼前一亮的空姐 Look 之外，最吸睛的莫過於她與反串扮女裝、穿上水手服的「金城安」周嘉洛大擺心心甫士的合照，搞笑十足！此外，她又晒出與吳偉豪（朱凌凌）化上滿頭白髮老人妝的珍貴花絮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">葉蒨文感性發文寫道：「10 years ago! #不見不散 #goodbyeNow! #復刻回憶仲有Venus &amp; Bonnie，係島大最難忘嘅回憶之一🥰 Thank you for everything guys! What a journey.」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">即使時光飛逝，相片中橫跨10年的葉蒨文，其美貌與初出道時幾乎毫無變化，凍齡顏值令網民相當羨慕。對Sophie而言，Candy 這個角色絕對是她演藝生涯中極具意義的里程碑。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866735837953426_22458690.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20261mqxTIY3Qp1785381294.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866735837953426_22458690.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866741743498252_22458690.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026hHUrlRXx2U1785381294.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866741743498252_22458690.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866738740389047_22458690.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20260rJjLEl2qC1785381294.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866738740389047_22458690.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866748546722078_22458690.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026pwTMknqM6t1785381294.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sophieysm_1785320538_3951866748546722078_22458690.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這批充滿回憶的照片一出，隨即引爆網民洗版式留言。大批粉絲感觸表示：「睇到10年前同10年後嘅相真係有啲眼濕濕」、「多謝 Candy 呢10年一路以嚟嘅陪伴🥹❤️ 真係陪住我哋走過好多回憶」、「我到而家都忘記唔到嗰段日子，每日準時衝返屋企，就係為咗準時睇島大」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有網民笑指照片中似乎少了一位重要人物：「點解冇復刻返 Mike &amp; Candy 嘅經典名場面？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T05:19:11.201661+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":632,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}